<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-035" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-035-hedong-xuan-yan" source-id="s-nanqishu-035-hedong-xuan-yan-ws2401782">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-035-hedong-xuan-yan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">河東王<persName id="c-nanqishu-035-hedong-xuan-yan:p001:m0003" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_D">鉉</persName>，字<persName id="c-nanqishu-035-hedong-xuan-yan:p001:m0006" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_D">宣胤</persName>，太祖第十九子也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-035-hedong-xuan-yan:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">四年，誅<persName id="c-nanqishu-035-hedong-xuan-yan:p002:m0004" ref="i08_s4b_5bb">王晏</persName>，以謀立<persName id="c-nanqishu-035-hedong-xuan-yan:p002:m0010" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_D">鉉</persName>為名，免<persName id="c-nanqishu-035-hedong-xuan-yan:p002:m0015" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_D">鉉</persName>官，以王還第， 禁不得與外人交通。</p>
</text>
